/T (In this manual, I will take you through the main stages of experiential work and introduce you to the types of question you might ask at each step. Please use this as a reference guide that orients you to all the pieces of clinical work worth learning about and as a jumping board for further research / training. This manual is not meant as a full \(or vetted\) training material related to the three therapies it draws from. But I hope it is helpful to those of us working to integrate between them. )
