548 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Once you feel that you and the client have gotten on the same page around what they are wanting to work on \(including what the issue looks and feels like and when / where it plays out\), then you can shift into creating compassionate contact with whatever might be underneath. This means we are mindfully turning toward whatever comes up so it can teach us about what the unconscious mind is holding in relation to this issue. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
549 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (If we can imagine that clarifying the target issue is like finding the place in the ground to dig, CONTACT is more about actually digging, ie slowing down and inviting into awareness whatever hidden part of us or our experience is ready to be seen or witness / explored. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
