570 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Working within an example is incredibly helpful. It allows you to slow down, rewind, get curious about what is/was happening internally \(so you can then move either in the direction of exploring COHERENCE or doing COMPLETION work\). Examples help the client come into genuine contact with their mind or experience as it actually happens/happened, rather than just talking vaguely or intellectually about it. Examples provide a portal back into their experience so they can explore it. )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
