<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (When you have a clear sense what the protector part \(defense\) is afraid of, then you can work to address those fears \(like, if the fear is of becoming overwhelmed, you can make an agreement with the exile ahead of time to not flood the system--we will talk about this technique at some point\). If you can actually assuage all the fears of the protector part, then it is likely to step aside so a new experience \(of deepening awareness of the suffering that is being protected from\) can emerge. If this approach sounds appealing, I suggest diving into some IFS training. )
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [3]
>>
