<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (As you are doing Discovery work, there are two equally valid pieces worth exploring: either emotions \(which then can move into COMPLETION work\), or emotional learnings \(schemas, which is what we might call COHERENCE work\). Likely you will do some of both, and that work can happen in either order, or go back and forth, as the work progresses. I will say,  I tend to lean into COHERENCE work first, because if I can get a really clear view of the emotional learning, I will know more exactly what kind of COMPLETION \(if any\) might be needed \(in order to serve as a disconfirmation\). )
/Pg 45 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
