1212 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (    "Dad, I learned from you that for a boy to be sad and cry is weak and pathetic. I believed you because to not believe you would put me at risk of behaving in ways that you couldn't stand and wouldn't love. So I had to toughen up! Not only to make you love me, but to avoid that horrible moment of punishment where you made me feel so pathetic and weak for crying.)
/Pg 66 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
