/S /P
/E ( -Inner Child Work. For instance, IFS work with exiles can disconfirm schemas re: aloneness / shame, or powerlessness \(redos\). Or hope in change \(unburdening exile\). Or need for self-protection \(unburdening protector part, after witnessing exile is now okay\). If you already outlined schema, you can craft revisiting more carefully with schema in mind. )
